<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Rooiberg issues further cautionary.</title>
<headline>Rooiberg issues further cautionary.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rooiberg Tin Ltd said on Friday that talks referred to on November 1 were expected to be concluded during February 1997.</p>
<p>The conclusion of the talks would be followed by an announcement.</p>
<p>Shareholders were advised to continue exercising caution in their sharedealings until then.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
